    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RS English — Web Tester\n\nPermite conversar com Emma pelo painel sem WhatsApp.\n\nTroque:\n- `https://SEU_DOMINIO`\n- `SUA_N8N_API_KEY`\n- `SUA_OPENAI_API_KEY`\n- `OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna`\n\nWebhook:\n`/rs-english-web`\n\nNo EasyPanel:\n`N8N_WEB_TEACHER_URL=https://SEU_N8N/webhook/rs-english-web`",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "86976adc-9ae1-4921-9686-a5e39858fa99",
      "name": "LEIA PRIMEIRO",
